---
// Work order — contact, as a job slip on the bench.
---
<section id="contact" class="relative">
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-24 md:py-32">
    <p
      class="reveal flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] text-ink-faint uppercase"
    >
      <span class="inline-block h-px w-10 bg-ink/30"></span>
      Station 07 &mdash; Work order
    </p>
    <h2
      class="reveal mt-6 font-display text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink md:text-6xl"
      style="--reveal-delay: 90ms"
    >
      Leave a note on <em class="font-light">the bench.</em>
    </h2>
    <p
      class="reveal mt-5 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft"
      style="--reveal-delay: 160ms"
    >
      Have a project to build, a server to tame, or a package idea? Write it up &mdash; the
      bench is clear.
    </p>

    <div
      class="reveal work-card relative mx-auto mt-14 max-w-2xl p-8 md:p-12"
      style="--reveal-delay: 240ms"
    >
      <div class="tape -top-3.5 left-10 -rotate-6"></div>
      <div class="tape -top-3.5 right-10 rotate-6"></div>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] text-ink-faint uppercase">
          Work order N&ordm; 001
        </p>
        <span class="stamp text-pen">Status: open</span>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 font-mono text-sm">
        <div class="flex gap-4 border-b border-dashed border-ink/20 pb-3">
          <span class="w-20 shrink-0 tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint uppercase">From</span>
          <span class="text-ink-soft">you</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 border-b border-dashed border-ink/20 pb-3">
          <span class="w-20 shrink-0 tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint uppercase">Subject</span>
          <span class="text-ink-soft">your project, in a sentence or two</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 border-b border-dashed border-ink/20 pb-3">
          <span class="w-20 shrink-0 tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint uppercase">To</span>
          <a
            href="mailto:contact@octopy.dev"
            class="text-ink underline decoration-marker/60 decoration-2 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-marker"
            >contact@octopy.dev</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      <a
        href="mailto:contact@octopy.dev?subject=Work%20order%20%E2%80%94%20project%20inquiry"
        class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-sm bg-marker px-8 py-4 font-mono text-sm tracking-[0.12em] text-paper uppercase transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        <i class="ph-duotone ph-envelope-simple text-xl"></i>
        File the work order
      </a>

      <div class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/supianidz"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="GitHub"
          class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-ink/15 text-ink-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-ink/40 hover:text-ink"
        >
          <i class="ph-duotone ph-github-logo text-2xl"></i>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://linkedin.com/in/supianidz"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="LinkedIn"
          class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-ink/15 text-ink-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-ink/40 hover:text-ink"
        >
          <i class="ph-duotone ph-linkedin-logo text-2xl"></i>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/628159826697?text=Hello%20Supian%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20project."
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="WhatsApp"
          class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-ink/15 text-ink-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-ink/40 hover:text-ink"
        >
          <i class="ph-duotone ph-whatsapp-logo text-2xl"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="relative z-10 border-t border-ink/15">
    <div
      class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wide text-ink-faint sm:flex-row"
    >
      <span>&copy; 2026 Octopy. All rights reserved.</span>
      <span>
        <a href="/notes" class="underline decoration-ink/30 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-ink">Field notes</a>
        &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
        <a href="/workshop" class="underline decoration-ink/30 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-ink">Workshop</a>
        &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Set by hand &middot; No cookies, no trackers
      </span>
    </div>
  </footer>
</section>
